        "richtext_gN9pBi": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>The human gut has been called “The Second Brain” because it’s similarly wired like the brain, with neurons and neurotransmitters. Your gut can play a role in brain-based disorders, like anxiety and depression, while gut bacteria can produce neurotransmitters like serotonin and dopamine, affecting brain function.<br/><br/></p><p>DIGESTIVE+++ contains probiotics, prebiotics, postbiotics, and digestive enzymes to promote a healthy and balanced gut . Butyrate is postbiotic produced by beneficial bacteria in the gut microbiome after taking DIGESTIVE+++. Butyrate has been shown to slow down signs of aging by encouraging brain and gut health.<br/><br/></p><p>Benefits of increased Butyrate production after taking DIGESTIVE+++:</p><p>•Reduces bloating*<br/>•Helps the body digest food and absorb more nutrients*<br/>•Manages weight*<br/>•Better elimination*<br/>•Less constipation and diarrhea*<br/>•Improved mood and energy*<br/>•Less brain fog*<br/>•Stronger immunity*<br/>•Less inflammation in the gut lining can help prevent colon conditions such as IBS*<br/><br/>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent disease.</p>"
          }
        },
